<title>JAPAN: Sanshin Elec files shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Sanshin Elec files shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sanshin Electronics Co Ltd said on Thursday that it had applied to the Finance Ministry for a shelf registration to issue up to 10 billion yen worth of corporate bonds.</p>
<p>The registration will be effective from August 6 and will be valid for two years, it said.</p>
